codex
The arbitrary-list invariant now closes with `#Top`. I’m strengthening it to cover mixed integer/float GPA lists (as in the prompt example) by normalizing each GPA with Python’s supported `float()` builtin before the decision tree; this is semantics-preserving for the task’s GPA domain and makes the symbolic list element type uniform.
apply patch
